## About Me

I'm an 18 y/o developer who likes working on projects that connect low-level systems and real user experiences. I enjoy exploring how games, apps, binaries, backends, and web platforms work under the hood.

Most of my curiosity lives around:

- Game modding, native hooks, Android internals, and runtime behavior.
- Web development with clean UI, fast APIs, and practical deployment.
- Reverse engineering for learning, debugging, and understanding software architecture.
- Building tools that are useful, direct, and easy to maintain.

